rac{\\frac{1}{10}}{\\left(\\frac{9}{10}\\right)^2} = \\frac{10}{81}.\n\\]\n\nThis confirms the sum converges to \\( \\frac{10}{81} \\).\n\n<answer>\\(\\frac{10}{81}\\)</answer>", "id": 78}
